public class LibraryMembershipTree { static class LibraryMember{int books;void borrowBook(){books++;}int getBooksBorrowed(){return books;}String displayInfo(){return "General Member | Books Borrowed: "+books;}}static class StudentMember extends LibraryMember{String c;StudentMember(String c){this.c=c;}String displayInfo(){return "Student Member | Course: "+c+" | Books Borrowed: "+books;}}static class HonorsStudentMember extends StudentMember{HonorsStudentMember(){super("ECE");}}static class FacultyMember extends LibraryMember{}static String classifyGeneration(LibraryMember m){return m instanceof HonorsStudentMember?"Multilevel descendant (3 generations deep)":m instanceof FacultyMember?"Hierarchical sibling (independent branch)":"Base or student";}static int total(LibraryMember[] m){int s=0;for(LibraryMember x:m)s+=x.getBooksBorrowed();return s;}public static void main(String[]a){System.out.println(classifyGeneration(new HonorsStudentMember()));} }
